{"summary":"Origin of life through sound","description":"Born from the origins of the Universe, you are a particle with the power to touch musical notes through waves.\n\nExplore this fascinating adventure guided by music, where sound becomes a puzzle made of rhythm, skill, and agility.\n\nSolve puzzles guided by Music:\nThe Lullaby of Life is a puzzle adventure where you'll encounter multiple cadence-based challenges. Solve them by matching sound waves in sequences of different colors and symbols. Challenge your way of thinking with each level, which introduces new puzzles and mechanics.\nAwaken new companions, bring life to inert beings, and carve your path through this abstract universe!\n\nVenture into the Universe:\nYou are the catalyst of new life wherever you go. Travel through the universe, avoid obstacles, explore hidden secrets, escape enemies and dangers, and immerse yourself in this journey—where each level has its own unique environment, characters, and aesthetic.\n\nBring Sleeping Beings to Life:\nAs you venture through the universe, you'll encounter various beings. The main objective and core of each level is to awaken the sleeping Elders by triggering sequences of sound waves—yours and those of your companions who will follow you on your path.","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Fear","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/209PSiyPQ10?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gCpJFATcqxThpHGWgn3NfH9Jtja7vuSd5F7i4E2inMHhsvi6BAnWNZyz1IYbKVan4SYwTNNAuIf5XXMTrBe0","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hp7skkclHvdjk6sYtD_0u8ci-AVqXht1fBz1NVDg2UR49T7yWaxVtTYtIObszaIQAtbfs3GdgyPp4hhXCLvj","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/P04tKg8qTTDVEtvYvw2piHNmParKtnMRJqVIKE1JaMOADXt1L_e3W3VrdDxgohLvPwDFwdLKLGZltsWKeBfgDaE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/G5POyzaQ7Z_VHCye650YAU0ioHfJEtHUUaXUovFAcdGl8NiLIJR49LenmywP_X33n1c92MHd72ZzeStpLt_2","https://play-lh.googleusercont